# Social output — the rendered 9:16 carousels and the raw app captures they are
# built from. Both are large PNGs and both are regenerable from _scripts/
# (cap-*.mjs then prog-post.mjs), so the repo carries the recipe, not the images.
# Each day's PLAN.md is text and IS tracked — that's the running order and captions.
Demand/social/posts/**/*.png
Demand/social/_source/feature-capture/*.png
Demand/social/_preview/**/*.png

# JetBrains IDE metadata — machine-local, not project state.
.idea/

# The drop box. Reference dumps, downloaded skills, anything pasted in to be
# read once and mined — it is an inbox, not project state, and it showed up as
# untracked in every git status until this line. Whatever earns a place in the
# project gets moved out of here and committed on its own terms.
Booklesss Bucket/
